# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (both use the repo root).
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra/load/fixture.json
infra/load/results
docs/api
# The Android app is not part of these images; its manifest stays so the lockfile matches.
apps/mobile/**
!apps/mobile/package.json
